        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Applications for our upcoming San Francisco cohort (SR006) are now open until *September 28, 2025* 🙌"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[Apply here](https://speedrun.a16z.com/apply?utm_source=speedrun-site&utm_campaign=SR006&utm_content=apply-button&utm_medium=home-page-top-bar)**"
