    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*How many founders are working full-time on your startup? (Founders are individuals with over 10% equity. If you’re part-time or not yet incorporated, enter ‘0’ and add all co-founders in the section below.)*"
