      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*How many full-time equivalent employees (including founders) are currently at your startup? (Part-time staff should be counted proportionally, e.g., two half-time employees = 1 FTE.)*"
